{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48941","headline":"次韵和卢先辈避难寺居看牡丹 · 王驾","name":"次韵和卢先辈避难寺居看牡丹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"乱後寄僧居，看花恨有余。\n香宜闲静立，态似别离初。\n朵密红相照，栏低画不如。\n狂风任吹却，最共野人疎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王驾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48941.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48941","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}